      "id": 466391,
      "username": "avc",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-04-27T17:51:56.587Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mohemd_ali\">@Mohemd_Ali</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smino\">@smino</a>:</p>\n<p>I am not an experienced developer, but saw this before (at least chunk size issue … don’t know if both are related)<br>\n.<br>\nTry to configure your <code>vite.config.js</code></p>\n<p>add this to <code>Build</code> into <code>defineConfig</code> function</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">    minify: true,     // Enable minification\n    chunkSizeWarningLimit: 1000,\n</code></pre>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
